  "id": "flicker-fusion-frequency",
  "term": "flicker fusion frequency",
  "definition": "Flicker fusion frequency, specifically critical flicker fusion frequency (CFF), is a measure used as an index of visual fatigue. In this context, a decrease in CFF indicates greater visual fatigue after visual viewing conditions such as 3D movie watching.",
